               <title>DESCRIPTION</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Niva-Plus™ is an orally administered prescription vitamin for the dietary management of patients with nutritional deficiencies or are in need of nutritional supplementation. Niva-Plus™ is an oval, beige tablet with "N050" debossed on one side.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20150312"/>
            </section>
